; toward .c names the side of .c as the one that stays, moving .c names it
; as the one that folds over: the fold fails (decisions/toward-names-the-side-that-stays).

paper square
fold (map .a onto .b) (toward .c) (moving .c)

; expect error "toward .c and moving .c name the same side of the fold line"
